## Personal content — All Rights Reserved

The following are personal content of Harshdip Saha and are **not** covered
by the MIT license. They may not be copied, reused, or redistributed
without explicit written permission:

- Case studies and project write-ups (`content/projects/*.mdx`)
- Site copy (`src/content/site.ts` — the text, not the schema)
- Effort records and audit trail (`aidlc-docs/`)
- Architecture Decision Records (`docs/adr/`)
- Résumé data and the compiled PDF (`resume.pdf`, `resume/`)
- Photographs (`gallery/`, `me.jpg`)
- The brain-sequence frames (`public/brain/`) — rendered from the ICBM 152
  template, whose own licence notice appears in the site's footer

If you want to build something similar, take the code. The words are mine.

